# Minimal imported-model asset for M7 (specs/milestones.md "M7 - GPU
# Triangle Rendering"). A regular-ish tetrahedron: 4 vertices, 4 triangular
# faces, no polygon triangulation required. Loaded through
# Core::ImportObjFile() by AppLayer to demonstrate the full
# model -> mesh -> GPU triangle buffer pipeline, distinct from the
# hand-authored quad mesh built directly in AppLayer.cpp.
v 0.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 0.0 0.0
v 0.5 0.0 0.866
v 0.5 1.0 0.289

f 1 2 3
f 1 2 4
f 1 3 4
f 2 3 4
